              %a{:href => "#MFF12"} MFF 12, table 16
          %h3#finite_subgroups_of_
            Finite subgroups of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 5
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} O(5)
          %p
            For classification of the finite subgroups of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 5
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} O(5)
            see
            %a{:href => "#MecchiaZimmermann10"} Mecchia-Zimmermann 10
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#SubgroupLattice Subgroup lattice
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subgroup"} subgroup
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice"} lattice
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SU%282%29"} SU(2)
            under the three exceptional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+group"} finite
            subgroups
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2T"} 2T
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2O"} 2O
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2I"} 2I
            (from Theorem
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ClassificationOfFiniteSubgroupsOfSO3"}
          %center
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/ADESubgroupLatticeUnderExceptional.jpg", :width => "490"}/
          %p
            This is obtained from the subgroup lattice as shown on
            %a{:href => "https://people.maths.bris.ac.uk/~matyd/GroupNames/"} GroupNames
            for
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mi I
                  %mo ≃
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2I \simeq
            %a{:href => "https://people.maths.bris.ac.uk/~matyd/GroupNames/97/SL(2,5).html"} SL(2,5)
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mi O
                  %mo ≃
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2O \simeq
            %a{:href => "https://people.maths.bris.ac.uk/~matyd/GroupNames/1/CSU(2,3).html"} CSU(2,3)
          %p
            See also
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#GoncalvesGuaschi11"} Goncalves-Guaschi 11, appendix
          %h3#GroupCohomology Group cohomology
          #GroupCohomologyOfFiniteSubgroupsOfSU2.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
                of
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+subgroups+of+SU%282%29"} finite subgroups of SU(2)
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                    %mover
                      %mo ↪
                      %mi i
                    %mi SU
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 2
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_{ADE} \xhookrightarrow{i} SU(2)
              be a
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+subgroup+of+SU%282%29"} finite subgroup of SU(2)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
              with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integer"} integer
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
              is as follows:
            #eq:IntegralGroupCohomologyOfFiniteSubgroupsOfSU2.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (1)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi H
                      %mi grp
                      %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                    %mo ,
                    %mi ℤ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mo ≃
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mrow
                      %mo {
                      %mrow
                        %mtable
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mi ℤ
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mo =
                              %mn 0
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %msubsup
                                %mi G
                                %mi ADE
                                %mi ab
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mo =
                              %mn 2
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mi mod
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mn 4
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mi ℤ
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                              %mrow
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                                %msub
                                  %mi G
                                  %mi ADE
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mtext positive multiple of
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mn 4
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mn 0
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mtext otherwise
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    H^n_{grp}(G_{ADE}, \mathbb{Z})
                    \\;\simeq\;
                    \\left\{
                    \\array{
                    \\mathbb{Z} &amp;\vert&amp; n = 0
                    \\\
                    G_{ADE}^{ab} &amp;\vert&amp;  n = 2 \, mod \, 4
                    \\\
                    \\mathbb{Z}/{\vert G_{ADE}\vert}
                    \&amp;\vert&amp;
                    n \, \text{positive multiple of} \, 4
                    \\\
                    0 &amp;\vert&amp; \text{otherwise}
                    }
                    \\right.
            %p
              Here
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                      %mi ab
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_{ADE}^{ab}
              denotes the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelianization"} abelianization
              of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_{ADE}
              and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \vert G_{ADE}\vert
              its
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cardinality"} cardinality
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℤ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %msub
                        %mi G
                        %mi ADE
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}/{\vert G_{ADE}\vert}
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+group"} cyclic group
              whose
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/order+of+a+group"} order
              is the cardinality of
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi G
                        %mi ADE
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_{ADE}
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+homology"} group homology
              with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integer"} integer
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
              is
            #eq:IntegralGroupHomologyOfFiniteSubgroupsOfSU2.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (2)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi H
                      %mi n
                      %mi grp
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mi ADE
                    %mo ,
                    %mi ℤ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mo ≃
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mrow
                      %mo {
                      %mrow
                        %mtable
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mi ℤ
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mo =
                              %mn 0
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %msubsup
                                %mi G
                                %mi ADE
                                %mi ab
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mo =
                              %mn 1
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mi mod
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mn 4
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mi ℤ
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                              %mrow
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                                %msub
                                  %mi G
                                  %mi ADE
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mi n
                              %mo =
                              %mn 3
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mi mod
                              %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                              %mn 4
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mn 0
                            %mtd
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                            %mtd
                              %mtext otherwise
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    H_n^{grp}(G_{ADE}, \mathbb{Z})
                    \\;\simeq\;
                    \\left\{
                    \\array{
                    \\mathbb{Z} &amp;\vert&amp; n = 0
                    \\\
                    G^{ab}_{ADE} &amp;\vert&amp;  n = 1 \, mod \, 4
                    \\\
                    \\mathbb{Z}/{\vert G_{ADE}\vert} &amp;\vert&amp; n = 3 \,mod\, 4
                    \\\
                    0 &amp;\vert&amp; \text{otherwise}
                    }
                    \\right.
          %p
            This general statement is summarized in
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#EpaGanter16"} Epa &amp; Ganter 16, p. 12
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "Pontrjagin+dual#BSST07"} BSST 07, Lem. 4.51
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#TomodaZvengrowski08"} Tomoda &amp; Zvengrowski 08, Section 4
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi H
                    %mn 3
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi G
                    %mi ADE
                  %mo ,
                  %mi ℤ
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo =
                  %msup
                    %mi H
                    %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi G
                    %mi ADE
                  %mo ,
                  %msup
                    %mi ℂ
                    %mo ×
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^3(G_{ADE},\mathbb{Z}) = H^2(G_{ADE}, \mathbb{C}^\times)
            is also
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#FHHP01"} FHHP 01, Cor. 3.1
          #DiscreteTorsion.num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/C-field"} C-field
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/discrete+torsion"} discrete torsion
            %p
              In discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetimes"} spacetimes
              with
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ADE-singularities"} ADE-singularities
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %munder
                      %munder
                        %mrow
                          %msubsup
                            %mi H
                            %mi grp
                            %mn 4
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %msub
                            %mi G
