              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://homepages.warwick.ac.uk/~masda/McKay/Carrasco_Project.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Complete proof of the classification of the finite subgroups of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SO
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 3
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(3)
            is also spelled out in
          %ul
            %li#DeVisscher11
              Maud De Visscher,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www.staff.city.ac.uk/maud.devisscher.1/GS/"} Groups and Symmetry
              lecture notes handout:
              %em Classification of finite rotation groups
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.staff.city.ac.uk/maud.devisscher.1/GS/classif_rotation.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            Based on the classification of the finite subgroups of
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi SO
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 3
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(3)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SU
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU(2)
            is spelled out in
          %ul
            %li#Keenan03
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Adam+Keenan"}> Adam Keenan
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Which finite groups act freely on spheres?
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.utah.edu/~keenan/actions.pdf"} pdf
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Groupprops"}> Groupprops
              ,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://groupprops.subwiki.org/wiki/Classification_of_finite_subgroups_of_SO(3,R)"} Classification of finite subgroups of SO(3,R)
          %p
            Discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice"} lattice
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subgroups"} subgroups
            of the three exceptional subgroups:
          %ul
            %li#GoncalvesGuaschi11
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daciberg+Lima+Gon%C3%A7alves"}> Daciberg Lima Gonçalves
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Guaschi"} John Guaschi
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Subgroups of the Binary Polyhedral Groups
              = succeed "," do
                %em The classification of the virtually cyclic subgroups of the sphere braid groups
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1110.6628"} arXiv:1110.6628
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-00257-6"} doi:10.1007/978-3-319-00257-6
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/bbm%3A978-3-319-00257-6%2F1.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
          %ul
            %li#TomodaZvengrowski08
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Satoshi+Tomoda"}> Satoshi Tomoda
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Zvengrowski"} Peter Zvengrowski
              = succeed "," do
                %em Remarks on the cohomology of finite fundamental groups of 3-manifolds
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0904.1876"} arXiv:0904.1876
          %p see also
          %ul
            %li#FHHP01
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bo+Feng"}> Bo Feng
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amihay+Hanany"} Amihay Hanany
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang-Hui+He"} Yang-Hui He
              = succeed "," do
